@5200 = ~Are you in league with druids?~

@5201 = ~I'm not a druid, but I have druids among my friends.~

@5202 = ~I am a druid myself.~

@5203 = ~Why do you ask?~

@5204 = ~Then, you will suffer my wrath. Come, my companions!~

@5205 = ~I'm here to kill as many druids as I can find. Some of them enter this area every now and then.~

@5206 = ~Explain the motive behind this hostile attitude towards druids.~

@5207 = ~Long time ago, an army of druids killed a mage in an unfair battle. I'm a here to seek revenge.~

@5208 = ~I am a mage myself, but I don't think what you said can justify killing all druids. Surely, none of the druids you may find here had any role in that old event.~

@5209 = ~Surely, none of the druids you may find here had any role in that old event.~

@5210 = ~I don't care for the lives of the druids, but I see that you are a madman who has some good magical stuff. It's better that I kill you and loot your body before druids do it with you.~

@5211 = ~You don't understand. It's a matter of honor. Now, give a clear answer to my question! Are you in league with druids?~

@5212 = ~You will either go from this place or will die. Am I clear?~

@5213 = ~I see that you have underestimated me. Come, my companions!~
